# What is the phone's own and stays on the computer that pulled it (no vendor firmware or phone data in a repository):
# the UEFI image built from its vendor drivers, its live device tree (it carries the phone's serial numbers), the drivers.
/prebuilt/SILICIUM_UEFI.fd
/prebuilt/device-tree.dtb
/prebuilt/BootShim.bin
/prebuilt/ramdisk
/uefi/files/Binaries/*/*
!/uefi/files/Binaries/*/README.md
/uefi/files/Resources/DTBs/
